    <briefdescription>
<para>Routines for creating Gaussian-shaped land surface topography for latitude-longitude grids. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Bruce Wyman</para></simplesect>
Interfaces generate simple Gaussian-shaped mountains from parameters specified by either argument list or namelist input. The mountain shapes are controlled by the height, half-width, and ridge-width parameters. </para>    </detaileddescription>
